    slug: "golden-ratio-myth",
    title: "The golden ratio is design's favorite myth. Here's what actually works.",
    dek: "People can't reliably pick the golden rectangle out of a lineup, and the famous Apple logo overlay doesn't hold up. The real math behind beautiful design is simpler.",
